{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_lmlee_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_lmlee_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "三餐一日",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lmlee_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "03114d6a75d783e8e2346752580a57a1ee0a730150a8cc1bbf0efd99f4ae7a94",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "先生，您在這菜市場來來回回轉了快有好幾圈了，是沒有找到需要的食材嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你在叫我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "嗯，菜市場就要關門了，您再不走，就得在裡面過夜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這才不到七點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "唉，一看您就不是本地人，這裡晚上亂得很，誰有膽子開門到那個時候？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......我確實是剛來沒幾天，昨天才在附近的旅館住下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "龍門那麼多地方可去，先生怎麼想著要來逛一逛這小小的菜市場？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "只是我的一個小習慣，每到一個新地方，就會去看看當地的菜市場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "風俗、人情、土宜，都能在這裡體現。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "菜市場而已，哪會有什麼不一樣？不過是人來人往，吵吵鬧鬧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "就比如......尚蜀的菜市場能徹夜不打烊，這裡就不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "啊......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "......先生您還要不要買菜了？不買我就收攤了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "有什麼推薦的嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "小暑節氣，天氣炎熱，不如買兩支茭白筍回家煲粥，解熱防暑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，還是不打擾了，旅館裡的冰箱不大，放不下這半米長的茭白筍。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "唉......真是個怪人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "耽誤我回家......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "老闆，你今天走得是不是有些早啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "（嘖，這混帳羔子......這麼早走都避不開。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "我的錢準備好了沒有？連帶著上個月拖欠的，一併給了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "這、這幾個月生意不景氣，實在是剩不下什麼孝敬給您的了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "那不正好，趕緊滾蛋，把攤子給有能力的人經營。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "哎哎，你做什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "放手，別砸了，別砸了！再寬限些時日吧，到時我一定籌到錢！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "哼，晚了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "慢著，小兄弟高抬貴手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "嘖，大爺你誰啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎呀，太抬舉了，你我以兄弟相稱就足夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "......你給我放尊重點，也不打聽打聽我上面是哪位人物？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "是位姓林的貴人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "既然知道，還不識相點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "（好傢伙，怎麼這城裡遇上的混混十個裡有八個都說自己是林先生的手下。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎呀，怪不得我覺得這位小兄弟面熟，想來在林先生的宅子裡見過面。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "啊......見、見過嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "對啊，去年林先生家裡的金桂開得正好，所以做了許多糖桂花。不知道小兄弟你收到沒有啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "當、當然，臨走前林先生送了我十多罐，根本吃不完。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎，等等......我記錯了，林先生家種的好像不是桂花，是桃樹。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "*龍門粗口*，你到底認不認識林先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我不一定認識，但你一定不認識。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "趕緊滾吧，聽說那位林先生治下頗嚴，要是知道有人冒用他的名號作惡，恐怕那人會吃不了兜著走啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "市井混混",
      "text": "呸，晦氣。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "那個......先生，謝謝您了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不過是動動嘴皮子的事情，不必介懷。下次遇上這種小人，不用害怕，多半是借勢欺人的混混，真正的黑幫哪有這麼不上道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "唉......我就是個小販，哪裡有什麼識人的本事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "對了，先生，您先別走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "旅館裡的冰箱雖小，但這一袋荔枝應該還是放得下的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "家裡種的，值不了幾個錢，就是片心意，先生就帶回去吃吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "......先生？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "啊，我在想，就是為幾顆荔枝的好滋味，走上這麼遠的路也算是值得了。多謝了，老闆。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "哎，先生您喜歡就好，有空記得常來光顧小攤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "一定一定。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "鯉先生，嘿，鯉先生！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎呀，蔡老闆，我還沒到菜市場，就聽到你在喊我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "我這不是怕留給你的這幾棵冬筍不新鮮了嘛。大寒時節，正是吃冬筍的好時候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "就這麼幾分鐘的時間，哪會壞得那麼快？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "帶回去記得泡鹽水啊，這樣存得久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "算了吧，我租的房子廚房只有那麼一點點大，放進保鮮袋丟冰箱就夠了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "不行，這可是上好的白眼筍，你是個講究人我才留給你的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "你放心，過兩天我要請一位貴客到屋子裡坐坐，存不久的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "鯉先生你在龍門交到朋友了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "還不算朋友。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "那要怎樣才能算鯉先生的朋友呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "林先生今天來幫太太買菜啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "我太太沒有那麼挑剔，不會因為幾棵筍，就讓我跑到離家十幾公里外的菜市場買菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "（鯉先生，這、這位不是......不是那位......？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "（你就當他是個普通過路人就行了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "鯉先生還沒有回答我的問題。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哈，我就是個市井俗人，誰在大酒樓設宴請我吃一頓，我定把他奉為知己。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "手下報給我的可不一樣。你這一周，出入的盡是街道巷陌的小館子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "林先生你知道那麼多我會出現的場所，為什麼偏偏來這離家十幾公里的菜市場尋我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "為了幾棵筍不值得跑十幾公里，但為了謝個朋友，還是值得的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "誇張了，我不過是幫襯著林先生你做了些小事。沒有我，這局面照樣也能收拾。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "這話你說錯了，要是沒有你，收拾出來的局面還真未必比現在好看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......哈，林先生，我自己幾斤幾兩，我自己最清楚。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "這幾棵筍品相上佳，你打算怎麼燒？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "簡簡單單做個油燜筍就夠鮮了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "這麼平實的燒法未免有些浪費，照我看，不如再提上一隻現殺的羽獸回家燉湯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，那吃的可就不是筍的鮮甜了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "何況......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "鯉先生不妨直說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哈，何況這幾棵筍原本長在鄉野，自有一種任心恣意的性情，想必也不願意給其他食材作配。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "怕就怕筍子生得太好，就算長在深山老林，也要引得挖筍人一波一波地來挖。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "如此一來，哪還能過上安然自得的日子呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哈哈，那都是後話了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "魏老二可不會無緣無故地上別人家作客......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "我有自信。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "什麼自信？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "自信......一旦魏大人拿起筷子，就不會停下嘴來和我多說一句話。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "哼......老闆，你這裡有蘋果嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "有有有，林先生您拿好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "多少錢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "不、不收您的錢，這些年多虧了您，大家才能安穩過日子。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "做生意不容易，收著吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "林先生不是說不買東西嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "來都來了，給女兒帶些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎呀，有了家室的人，到底是不一樣。本來還想明年邀你一起去姜齊遊湖賞花，看來是要作罷了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "林",
      "text": "你還是早些成家，不要到處漂了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "算了吧，安頓下來過日子不是我所求。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "夫人您看，這是當季的青梅，皮薄肉厚核小，味道酸中帶甘，吃了口舌生津。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "呃......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "您現在要是不秤個幾斤回家泡酒，等清明過去了，這滋味就再享受不到了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "行......給我秤一點吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "好好，有道是“青梅煮酒鬥時新”......哈，沒什麼文化，就光記得這麼一句。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "老蔡，老遠就聽到你哄著客人掏腰包，你這嘴啊......越來越滑了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "哎呀，做生意嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "鯉先生是這裡的常客？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "好久不見，夫人今天怎麼想到光顧這裡了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "這是龍門最大，也是貨物最齊全的菜市場。我想，買食材的話，這裡自然是不二之選。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "什麼事需要夫人親自來採買食材？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "嗯，彥吾幾天後要過生日，我想下廚為他做幾道菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "夫人想做什麼菜？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "......還沒有想好，無非是彥吾常吃的那幾道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "魏大人愛吃的那幾樣......可能有些考驗夫人的廚藝了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "咳咳，我想......有心不怕費功夫。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "也是。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "不過......我第一次來菜市場，確實不知道怎麼挑，勞煩鯉先生略施援手。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "沒問題，就比如說這番茄，要是拿它當水果生吃，就買粉紅色的，吃著口感略脆；要是炒菜，就選深紅色的，味道濃厚，也容易出汁。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "嗯，我記住了。那邊有芋頭，我想買一些做芋泥煙肉脯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "芋頭啊，如果個頭差不多的話，就買重一些的那個，水多澱粉也多，吃起來軟糯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "好。那香菇呢，我該買乾的，還是新鮮的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "各有各的好，看夫人要做什麼菜。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "仔薑鮮肉釀香菇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "那要用乾香菇，泡發之後香味更足。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哦......原來如此。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "對了，往前走還有一家賣豉油的店，正好買來製成豉油汁燒羽獸。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "（可是那家最近漲價了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "（老蔡，這你就多慮了。）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "做玫瑰豉油汁嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "鯉先生弄錯了，彥吾是常吃這道菜，但其實是因為我喜歡，所以才跟著一起吃了多年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......我知道。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "嗯？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "之前聽魏大人在飯桌上說起過。我想，因為夫人喜歡，所以魏大人愛屋及烏，倒也不稀奇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "......噗嗤。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "我覺得鯉先生的嘴，比生意人還要滑。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哈哈，要說生意人，最近我還真算得上。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "你不是一向逍遙自在的嗎？當初彥吾多次請你出任近衛局要職，你都拒絕了。怎麼也開始愁起生計了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "家裡又添了一張嘴，幫人跑跑腿多賺幾個飯錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "哦，你終於要成家了？改天我和彥吾必攜禮登門拜訪貴夫人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哪裡的事......是一個老友遠遊去了，丟下一個孩子孤零零的，我就接過來住了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "（搖頭）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "真是不負責......他有說自己什麼時候回來嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "沒有......但總不可能真的丟下孩子不管吧。估計幫他看顧幾個月，他就回來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "等把孩子交還給他，我也打算學學他，遠遊去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "龍門不好嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "好是好，可我是個浪蕩人，一個地方再好也待不久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "text": "唉，多謝鯉先生的指點，東西採買得差不多，我也該回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "夫人慢走。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "鯉先生，哎，鯉先生。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "啊......蔡老闆，找我有事？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "鯉先生你站這裡半天了，別人還要買菜呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......不好意思，咳咳。你這進口櫻桃怎麼賣？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "鯉先生不是嫌貴，從來不買嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉，小丫頭愛吃，買幾斤回家嚐嚐。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "老蔡，我上周在你這裡定的那批食材到了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "到了到了，就等你過來取了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎呀，不好意思，今天家裡有點事情，讓你久等了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "不打緊不打緊，這才九點不到，天還沒黑，離關門還早呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "不過，今天怎麼是你來？沒讓手下那個大個子學徒來跑腿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "他今天有活做，剛剛搬了新屋，他得帶著槐琥和阿打掃整理房間。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "搬新屋？怎麼，原來的房子住不自在啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "房間太少了，招待客戶不方便。廚房也太小，我還想再在裡面放一個冰櫃。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "兩個冰箱還不夠啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "好多人一起吃飯哪。幸好吽也算學出來了，能幫忙一起掌勺，不然燒飯都要累死人了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "要我說，你這一身本事啊，別的沒人學都不可惜，唯獨這廚藝，可萬萬不能失傳。有他在，我也是放心了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "他啊，才學了個皮毛，還差些火候。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "那今天你是打算親自開伙？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "嗯，他們忙了一天，也是該犒勞犒勞。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "哈哈，那這一盆金桔你端走吧，就當我祝你的事務所開業大吉，發大財。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哎喲，這盆金桔我記得擺在店裡可有好幾年了，你不是一向寶貝得很，別人輕易都碰不得。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這寒露剛過，才結滿了果，怎麼......今天說送就送給我了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "老鯉啊，不瞞你說，這菜店我不打算開下去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......你要遷址了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "我該退休啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "是有十幾年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "算上從前你沒來的日子，快有三十年了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "上個月通知傳過來，說這裡明年會拆掉，要改建成大型超市，雖說店鋪到時可以保留下來。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "龍門這幾年......拆掉的地方未免有些太多了，家附近的茶樓也拆了，說要改成咖啡店。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "就是啊。算了，我們夫妻倆操勞這麼多年，正好停下來休息休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "何況你一雙兒女也都長大，各自成家離開，繼續守著這家店也沒有什麼意思，不如到處走走，四處看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "在龍門這麼多年，我們還從來沒有去過大炎的其他城市。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "這些年存下的積蓄再加上政府補償的拆遷費，也夠我們好好玩上幾年。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "老鯉啊，你去過的地方那麼多，有沒有什麼推薦啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "......在龍門待了這麼多年，突然讓我回憶當時雲遊四方的經歷，也確實難說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "不過細細想來，不好的那些都已經是過眼雲煙，記不清晰，留下來的啊......多是當地宜人的風光和溫暖的人情。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "還有吵鬧的菜市場。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "哈哈哈哈哈......你還記得那些話啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "等我去了尚蜀，一定第一時間去那徹夜不打烊的菜市場看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "好......好啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "這麼多年，回回看見你，你都說要離開龍門，結果十幾年過去了，走的卻是我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "是啊，陰差陽錯，每每要離開，每每都有事絆住了腳步。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "唉......老蔡，許多人臨行前，都要來我這裡算上一卦，卜卜吉凶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "這麼多年的朋友，今天我就免費給算算，你這一路到底是個什麼光景。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "哎，好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "怎麼說？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "此卦乃世旺卦，屬大吉之相，這一路上必然身體康健，往來平安，事事順遂。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "哈哈哈，你講話總是這麼好聽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老鯉",
      "text": "老蔡啊，這可不是好聽話，是我真心所願。往後......我們有緣再見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "菜販",
      "text": "......有緣再見了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "超市廣播",
      "text": "快入冬了快入冬了，超市大酬賓，新鮮肉類買一送一。快入冬了快入冬了，超市大酬賓，新鮮肉類買......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "排了這麼久，吽哥，到底還要多久才能排到我們啊？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "再等等，今天超市大酬賓，人肯定是多些。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "就為了一塊腿肉，站得人腿都麻了。我練武時站樁都沒有這麼累。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "幾天前鯉先生特意點了蔥油燴腿肉，說要在生日的時候吃，正好今天超市里有新鮮現宰的，過幾天再買就只有冷凍貨了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "年紀一把，他反而越來越像小孩了，想吃什麼，片刻都不能等。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "生日就是滿足心願的日子嘛。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "你嘴上這麼說，不還是早早就買好了生日禮物藏在房間裡。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你......怎麼知道的？都說我的房間不用你打掃了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "我沒進你的房間......是丟垃圾的時候看到了一大袋子的包裝紙。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "唉，我也沒想到包個禮物有那麼難，拆了包，包了拆，好不容易才折平整。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "超市員工",
      "text": "先生，您要什麼？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "來塊腿肉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "超市員工",
      "text": "前腿後腿？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "後腿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "槐琥，你有看到阿嗎？怎麼還沒回來？一會拿了腿肉我們就要結帳回去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "不知道啊，一進超市門他就跑得沒影了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "（四處打量）嘖......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "看到了，那不就是他，正朝我們這邊走呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你是跑去買什麼了，這麼久都不見人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "沒什麼，就是到處逛了逛，看看有什麼能買給老鯉的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "什麼也沒看中？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "嘿嘿，沒有。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收銀員",
      "text": "你好，先生，一共四百七十一龍門幣，現金還是刷卡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "姑娘......這是不是算錯了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "收銀員",
      "text": "怎麼會呢？都是機器算的帳，不會錯的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "（奇怪，怎麼比我算的還要多？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "槐琥，你把手提袋打開，我再點點。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "吽哥，別計較了，或許就是你算錯了，趕緊提著東西回家吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "對啊對啊，出來一整天了，我看槐琥姐簡直累得筋疲力盡，還是趕緊回家休息吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽&槐琥",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "......槐琥，把袋子給我。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "......給，吽哥，你可得仔細看看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "（哎呀，多話了......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "腿肉、白蘿蔔、南瓜、蓮藕......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "哎，吽哥，袋子最底下好像有一個藥材包。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "阿——阿嚏！咳咳咳......好刺鼻。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "吽",
      "text": "咳咳咳，呸呸，這是什麼東西？！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "唉，不怪我，是你們非要拿出來看的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "我就是覺得，你們給老鯉送的東西，嘖，都太沒勁了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿",
      "text": "你們隨後跟上來，我就先走啦。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "咳咳咳......你、你......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "槐琥",
      "text": "你這個混小子，給我回來！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
